{
  "info": {
    "name": "santi-bank :: AgentCore Gateway FGAC",
    "description": "Coleccion E2E para validar Fine-Grained Access Control (FGAC) del AgentCore Gateway de santi-bank.\n\n## Como funciona la autenticacion (CERO fricciones)\n\nCada folder de usuario (santi / jimmy / joacho) tiene un PRE-REQUEST SCRIPT que:\n1. Revisa si hay un token cacheado para ese usuario (variable `token_<user>` con timestamp < 6h).\n2. Si no hay o expiro, hace login automatico contra Cognito (InitiateAuth USER_PASSWORD_AUTH).\n3. Setea `access_token` y `current_user` -> todos los requests del folder lo heredan via Bearer Auth.\n\nSolo abre el folder del usuario que quieras y dale Send (o corre TODA la coleccion con el Collection Runner y veras todos los tests en verde).\n\n## Matriz de permisos esperada\n\n| Usuario | saldo | tarjetas | canales | preferencias |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| santi | SI | SI | SI | SI |\n| jimmy | SI | SI | NO | SI |\n| joacho | SI | NO | SI | NO |\n\n## Origin Cloaking (WAF) 🧱\n\nEl Gateway tiene un WAF asociado que SOLO permite trafico con el header secreto X-Origin-Verify (inyectado por CloudFront). Por eso `gateway_url_direct` retorna 403/-32002 SIEMPRE (es el comportamiento esperado, validado en el Folder 6). Usa `mcp_url` (custom domain) para el flujo normal.\n\n## Variables\n\n- `mcp_url`: endpoint MCP (custom domain via CloudFront) - el UNICO camino permitido por el WAF.\n- `gateway_url_direct`: URL directa del Gateway - bloqueada por origin cloaking (solo util para el Folder 6).\n- `client_id` / `password`: credenciales demo de Cognito.\n- Folder 5 (opcional) requiere credenciales AWS (SigV4) para el flip dinamico de permisos en DynamoDB.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "mcp_url", "value": "https://santi-bank-fine-access.cb.events.genai.aws.dev/mcp", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "gateway_url_direct", "value": "https://santi-bank-gateway-dev-kiogzebcfh.gateway.bedrock-agentcore.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/mcp", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "cognito_endpoint", "value": "https://cognito-idp.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "client_id", "value": "4ilvj9e26ovcv37g152tranglc", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "password", "value": "Testing123.", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "access_token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "current_user", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "aws_access_key_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "aws_secret_access_key", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "aws_session_token", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Auth manual (opcional - login explicito)",
      "description": "Requests explicitos de login para VER el flujo de Cognito en la demo. NO son obligatorios: los folders 1-3 se auto-autentican solos con pre-request scripts.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login santi",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Login santi -> HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const token = pm.response.json().AuthenticationResult?.AccessToken;",
                  "pm.test('AccessToken presente', () => pm.expect(token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('token_santi', token);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('token_santi_ts', String(Date.now()));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', token);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('current_user', 'santi');",
                  "console.log('Token de santi guardado y activado');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-amz-json-1.1" },
              { "key": "X-Amz-Target", "value": "AWSCognitoIdentityProviderService.InitiateAuth" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{cognito_endpoint}}", "host": ["{{cognito_endpoint}}"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"AuthFlow\": \"USER_PASSWORD_AUTH\",\n  \"ClientId\": \"{{client_id}}\",\n  \"AuthParameters\": {\n    \"USERNAME\": \"santi\",\n    \"PASSWORD\": \"{{password}}\"\n  }\n}"
            }
          }
        },
